sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as DSP API Server / CLI / UI
    participant ArgoServer as Argo Server<br/>2746/TCP gRPC+HTTP
    participant Gatekeeper as Gatekeeper<br/>Auth Interceptor
    participant gRPC as gRPC Service Layer<br/>(WorkflowService, etc.)
    participant Controller as Workflow Controller<br/>6060/TCP (healthz)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant StepPod as Step Pod +<br/>argoexec sidecar

    Note over ArgoServer,Gatekeeper: Authentication Modes:<br/>Client (Bearer/Basic → K8s impersonation)<br/>Server (argo-server SA)<br/>SSO (OIDC + optional RBAC delegation)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,gRPC: Workflow Submission Flow
        Client->>ArgoServer: POST /api/v1/workflows<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / OIDC
        ArgoServer->>Gatekeeper: Authenticate request
        alt Client Auth Mode
            Gatekeeper->>K8sAPI: Impersonate caller token<br/>SelfSubjectAccessReview
            K8sAPI-->>Gatekeeper: Access granted
        else SSO Auth Mode
            Gatekeeper->>Gatekeeper: Validate OIDC token<br/>Check RBAC delegation rules
        else Server Auth Mode
            Gatekeeper->>Gatekeeper: Use argo-server SA
        end
        Gatekeeper-->>ArgoServer: Authenticated context
        ArgoServer->>gRPC: WorkflowService.CreateWorkflow
        gRPC->>K8sAPI: Create Workflow CR<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>gRPC: Workflow created
        gRPC-->>ArgoServer: Workflow response
        ArgoServer-->>Client: JSON/gRPC response
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Controller,StepPod: Workflow Execution Flow
        K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: Workflow CR created
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Step Pod<br/>(inject argoexec sidecar)
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Pod created
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ConfigMap<br/>(memoization cache)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create PodDisruptionBudget
        StepPod->>StepPod: Execute workflow step
        StepPod->>K8sAPI: Report WorkflowTaskResult CR<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: TaskResult
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Workflow CR status
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,Controller: Observability
        Client->>ArgoServer: GET /metrics
        ArgoServer-->>Client: Prometheus metrics
        Client->>Controller: GET /healthz (port 6060)
        Note right of Controller: No authentication
        Controller-->>Client: 200 OK
    end
